The giant mimics in Sokoban more often than not prevent me from
completing Sokoban during a protection run.  However, there are
configuration with the giant mimics that potentially allow for
completion of the puzzle.

If you're determined to complete Sokoban at XL=1, then my
recommendation is to either leave your pets below (keeping in mind
your escape route) while you push boulders and then use your magic
whistle to move your pets past the mimics.  Giant mimics and Watch
Captains are big hazards for buff pets; use a magic whistle or a leash
to keep your pets safe.

Good skill/luck on your petless-pacifist run to the altar (if you
continue)!  It's certainly possible although very dangerous.  You
might be better off using a pick rather than looking for the stairs.

